{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8VpOMg_vrxGTg-Jnej327A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:25.883733+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8VpOMg_vrxGTg-Jnej327A","html":"<div><h1><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/d1ibicrI4w9WQiaibFJYdkY42dmbKN6EcJqoGTjJX1NaAa29qv6pB67T0kGydtEd2RvRWxDUf3AFpyPD0rEpEAorYg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\"/></span></h1><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ljib4So7yuWiaQG08xN7cCKBlcnQQSS17EuUP64loyjQeFIPibib1uGcR3LKkeE7KZx1takribB5hW7XPnJ29OS7jFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/d1ibicrI4w9WSNLyQpiaYeOFnFGhcmCBMgDemdVyUlj9IWJ9gPSaxsscic2icRm1pnjicns1fQEUIchC5zB7iajVB19eg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>西南交通大学建筑学院热忱欢迎全国各地优秀大学生通过推荐免试方式攻读我院研究生。为做好2026级推荐免试研究生工作，我院将于</span><span>2025年9月9日至9月16日</span><span>期间进行推免生意向征集工作，现将具体事项通知如下：</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟接受推免生学科专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ljib4So7yuWiaQG08xN7cCKBlcnQQSS17EuUP64loyjQeFIPibib1uGcR3LKkeE7KZx1takribB5hW7XPnJ29OS7jFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>学术学位：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>建筑学、城乡规划学</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>专业学位：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>建筑、城乡规划、风景园林、美术与书法</span></span></p><p><span><span>关于以上专业的具体招生情况，以我校研究生院官网主页公布的招生简章为准。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>征集范围</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ljib4So7yuWiaQG08xN7cCKBlcnQQSS17EuUP64loyjQeFIPibib1uGcR3LKkeE7KZx1takribB5hW7XPnJ29OS7jFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>已获得就读学校推荐免试资格，且申请我院推荐免试研究生的优秀应届本科毕业生可参加本次意向征集（含本院学生），填报</span><span><span>一次</span></span><span>即可。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>征集流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ljib4So7yuWiaQG08xN7cCKBlcnQQSS17EuUP64loyjQeFIPibib1uGcR3LKkeE7KZx1takribB5hW7XPnJ29OS7jFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>1.有意向报名我院推免生的同学长按或扫描二维码报名申请。</span><span><span>截止时间：2025年9月16日 24:00</span></span><span>。</span></span></strong><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/d1ibicrI4w9WTPRbHvI0bgX8X9SAYITBjlaJbhicVR3siaBFBfvPUXBNLtMHDnfpzn58LianH70NYGlNXBwozT3JhHA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>2026级建筑学院推荐生意向征集调查表（基本信息）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（长按二维码识别）</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2.2026级建筑学院推免生意向征集（附件材料）</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span></p><p><span><span>请参与意向征集的同学填写完“2026级建筑学院推免生意向征集</span><span><span>调查表</span></span><span>（基本信息）”报名链接后，提交以下个人相关证明材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1）身份证、学生证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2）本科 阶段成绩单和排名证明材料扫描件（需加盖教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3）外语水平证明扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4）个人简历及获奖证书扫描件。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.请于</span><span><span>2025年9月16日前</span></span><span>将相关材料发至</span><span><span>邮箱jdjianzhu@163.com</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。全部证明材料请按以上顺序合成一个PDF文件，以“推免意向专业名称-本科院校名称-学生姓名”方式命名发送。</span><span><span>请注意控制附件大小，附件整体大小建议不超过10M，</span></span><span>学院将对参与意向征集的同学所提供的信息进行审核。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>温馨提醒</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ljib4So7yuWiaQG08xN7cCKBlcnQQSS17EuUP64loyjQeFIPibib1uGcR3LKkeE7KZx1takribB5hW7XPnJ29OS7jFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>推荐免试研究生报名及录取工作均须在教育部规定时间内通过教育部“全国推荐优秀应届本科生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（简称推免服务系统，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）完成。凡被我校接收的推免同学，由学校通过“推免服务系统”发布待录取通知，学生收到待录取通知后，须在规定时间内通过“推免服务系统”确认拟录取，否则视为放弃。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/d1ibicrI4w9WR3AazJuVBWibSQw4ibu1KydAicQVlZPVDpRicTj471G5ddnD2YaGOyJgxzqfSHhjWAZxeGWOnOqFa4gA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>（相关解释权归西南交通大学建筑学院所有）</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><strong><span><span>编辑丨刘野</span></span></strong></span></strong><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/d1ibicrI4w9WTZ2zpSkwstRyfW5piat6w8P8FCep5Ziap5ic7xGt5iatSVWuwDpxCBYYZpqR7h8c73wsD1khbFUErTbw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"18dc5db5c02a21dc00bb1fdcb3bc8f6f525cf8a14ef069385811fc73a08030e6","textLength":847,"sourceSha256":"238635cc61d23a9da7e4464e979ab19f5f84080c2981c0b02dd51ccf6507ac7f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f86446af984f35443da5","title":"2025年西南交通大学建筑学院2026级推免生意向征集的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:25.883733+00:00"}
